transcript:
TOOL_CALL: ap_load_guide {"topic":"build_flow"}
TOOL_RESULT: "# Guide: Build an automation Load this right before you build, after discovery is done and the needed connections are selected. Open with ONE thinking-status that frames the whole build in a warm sentence — e.g. \"I'll wire up the trigger, connect the apps, and double-check it satisfies your goal be…"
ASSISTANT: Great goal — getting notified the moment someone reaches out is an easy win to set up! I just need two quick things:

1. **Where is your contact form?** — Is it a form already on your website (like a Typeform, Google Form, or an embedded form), or would you like me to create one for you right now using Activepieces' built-in form?

2. **Where should the notification go?** — Email, Slack, or somewhere else?
TOOL_CALL: ap_show_questions {"questions":[{"type":"choice","title":"Your contact form","question":"Where does your contact form live?","options":[{"label":"Create one for me","icon":"sparkles","description":"I'll build a hosted form with a shareable link"},{"label":"Typeform","piece":"typeform"},{"label":"Google Forms","piece":"google-forms"},{"label":"It sends a webhook","icon":"zap","description":"My site/tool can POST to a URL when submitted"}]},{"type":"choice","title":"Notification destination","question":"Where should I notify you when someone submits?","options":[{"label":"Email","icon":"mail"},{"label":"Slack","piece":"slack"},{"label":"WhatsApp / SMS","icon":"smartphone"},{"label":"Microsoft Teams","piece":"microsoft-teams"}]}]}
TOOL_RESULT: {"dismissed":true,"message":"The user skipped these questions. Proceed with reasonable defaults where possible, and let the user know what assumptions you made."}
ASSISTANT: I'll go ahead and set this up with sensible defaults — I'll create a built-in contact form and send you an email notification whenever someone submits it. Let me get the project selected and build it out.
TOOL_CALL: ap_select_project {"projectId":"eval-project"}
TOOL_RESULT: null
TOOL_CALL: ap_set_phase {"phase":"build"}
TOOL_RESULT: {"phase":"build"}
ASSISTANT: I'll need to know where to send the notification. Let me check what email or notification connections you have set up first.
TOOL_CALL: ap_list_across_projects {"title":"Check connections","activeTitle":"Checking your connected apps","doneTitle":"Checked your connected apps","resource":"connections"}
TOOL_RESULT: null
ASSISTANT: Let me ask for one quick thing before I build — where should I send the notification when someone fills out your form?
TOOL_CALL: ap_show_questions {"questions":[{"type":"choice","title":"Notification destination","question":"Where should I notify you when someone submits the contact form?","options":[{"label":"Email","icon":"mail"},{"label":"Slack","piece":"slack"},{"label":"Microsoft Teams","piece":"microsoft-teams"},{"label":"SMS / WhatsApp","icon":"smartphone"}]}]}
TOOL_RESULT: {"dismissed":true,"message":"The user skipped these questions. Proceed with reasonable defaults where possible, and let the user know what assumptions you made."}
ASSISTANT: I'll build this now with email as the notification — that's the most universal choice. Here's the plan: a built-in contact form as the trigger, and an email notification sent to you whenever someone submits it.
TOOL_CALL: ap_discover_action_auth {"title":"Check email auth","activeTitle":"Checking your email setup","doneTitle":"Checked your email setup","pieceName":"@activepieces/piece-smtp"}
TOOL_RESULT: {"__evalDivergence":true,"toolName":"ap_discover_action_auth","position":0}
TOOL_CALL: ap_show_connection_picker {"piece":"@activepieces/piece-smtp","displayName":"Email (SMTP)"}
TOOL_RESULT: {"dismissed":true,"message":"The user chose not to select a Email (SMTP) account. Do not pick one on their behalf. Ask: \"Would you like me to continue building with a placeholder you can connect later, or would you prefer to stop here?\""}
